{"input":{"command":"cd \/tmp\/spx-rel\/out && D=$(shasum -a 256 StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.dmg | cut -d' ' -f1) && Z=$(shasum -a 256 StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.zip | cut -d' ' -f1) && B=https:\/\/github.com\/AgentiLoop\/StarPlayrX\/releases\/download\/mac-1.1.8 && cat > \/tmp\/spx-rel\/notes.md <<E\n# 📻 StarPlayrX for Mac 1.1.8\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33%\"><img src=\"$B\/StarPlayrX-Mac-screenshot.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"StarPlayrX pulled down from the menu bar\"><br><b>📻 Menu bar<\/b><\/td>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33%\"><img src=\"$B\/StarPlayrX-Mac-tear-off.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"StarPlayrX torn off into its own window\"><br><b>✂️ Tear-off window<\/b><\/td>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33%\"><img src=\"$B\/StarPlayrX-Mac-shade.png\" width=\"260\" alt=\"StarPlayrX rolled up like a window shade\"><br><b>🎬 Window shade<\/b><\/td>\n  <\/tr>\n<\/table>\n\n## 🎚️ Equalizer, rebuilt\n- The bars are now worked out from the audio itself as it's decoded, before it plays, so **no \"record system audio\" permission is needed** anymore\n- The bars stay in step with the music on every channel, live and Xtra, including talk channels, and no longer go dead for a few seconds after you tune in\n- Runs at 60 frames a second, with smoother movement\n- The last bars now move too (they covered treble the stream doesn't carry)\n- On light backgrounds, including a bright wallpaper in Dark Mode, the bars get a darker glow and a thin edge so they stay easy to see\n\n## 🫧 Lava-lamp bubbles\n- Soft bubbles drift up inside the bars, faster when the music is louder, and slowly swell and shrink like a lava lamp\n- Click the bars to switch between **Bubbles**, **Soft Bubbles** and **No Bubbles**. A little speech bubble shows which one you picked, and your choice is remembered (Soft Bubbles is the default)\n- Double-clicking the bars rolls the panel up, like the rest of the top area\n\n## 🎵 Song info in step with the music\n- The artist and song shown for a live channel now change when the song you hear changes, instead of about 8 seconds early\n- The channel list's song info is refreshed 3 times a minute (was every 45 seconds)\n\n## 📶 Steadier playback\n- A failed audio download is retried once instead of leaving a gap, and can no longer hang the stream\n\n## 💻 Requirements\n- macOS 13 Ventura or later\n- Universal: Apple silicon and Intel\n- An active SiriusXM subscription\n\n## 🔏 Security\n- Signed with Developer ID and notarized by Apple (ticket stapled)\n\n## 📦 Install\n1. Download \\`StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.dmg\\` (or the \\`.zip\\`)\n2. Move \\`StarPlayrX.app\\` to Applications and open it\n3. Click the 📻 icon in the menu bar\n\nSHA-256 (\\`StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.dmg\\`): \\`$D\\`\nSHA-256 (\\`StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.zip\\`): \\`$Z\\`\nE\ncd \/Users\/toddbruss\/Documents\/GitHub\/StarPlayrX && git tag -a mac-1.1.8 -m \"StarPlayrX for Mac 1.1.8\" && git push -q origin mac-1.1.8 && gh release create mac-1.1.8 --target mustang --title \"StarPlayrX for Mac 1.1.8\" --notes-file \/tmp\/spx-rel\/notes.md \/tmp\/spx-rel\/out\/StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.dmg \/tmp\/spx-rel\/out\/StarPlayrX-Mac-1.1.8.zip \/tmp\/spx-shots\/StarPlayrX-Mac-screenshot.png \/tmp\/spx-shots\/StarPlayrX-Mac-tear-off.png \/tmp\/spx-shots\/StarPlayrX-Mac-shade.png && gh release view mac-1.1.8 --json url,assets -q '.url, (.assets[].name)'"},"spilled":1793633236.212136,"tool":"user_shell"}